Package: clustermax-collector
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bitscan maintainers
Depends: bitscan-agent, python3 (>= 3.10)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ClusterMAX audit helper for Bitscan (TS 3.8)
 Runs the fixed ClusterMAX audit (cmax audit -vvv -y) as root when the
 Bitscan runner asks over /run/clustermax/collect.sock, and keeps the report
 only in memory. Install it only on hosts that a ClusterMAX policy targets.
 ClusterMAX is pinned at lusterless/clustermax @COMMIT@ (Apache-2.0).
